ing - or so I hope. In the past two seasons, I’ve done the origins of 50 brands. This season, we look at the origin of some of the greatest songs of all time. </p>\n<p>I’m your host, Deepak Gopalakrishnan, also known as Chuck. Say hello!<br>Twitter: twitter.com/chuck_gopal <br>Instagram: instagram.com/chuckofalltrades<br>Email: chuck@chuckofalltrades.in</p>", "Summary": "A short-format podcast where I give you the origins, the backstories - slightly dramatized but 100% true - of things that you know, love, and use. I reveal what I’m talking about only at the very end keeping you, the listener, guessing - or so I hope. In the past two seasons, I’ve done the origins of 50 brands. This season, we look at the origin of some of the greatest songs of all time.", "Tags": ["wonderwall", "oasis wonderwall", "andy bell", "fender", "noel"], "TranscriptUrl": null, "HasPublishedTranscript": false, "Season": 3, "Episode": 13, "EpisodeType": "Full", "ImageUrl": "https://www.omnycontent.com/d/clips/e0dce4b3-2eb8-48cb-822c-af1d00e03e20/df53fb75-753c-40e3-9fe9-af4d00ba5f96/bbca9217-153b-4a88-a157-afb000e827aa/image.jpg?t=1676989110&size=Medium", "AudioUrl": "https://traffic.omny.fm/d/clips/e0dce4b3-2eb8-48cb-822c-af1d00e03e20/df53fb75-753c-40e3-9fe9-af4d00ba5f96/bbca9217-153b-4a88-a157-afb000e827aa/audio.mp3", "WaveformUrl": "https://www.omnycontent.com/d/clips/e0dce4b3-2eb8-48cb-822c-af1d00e03e20/df53fb75-753c-40e3-9fe9-af4d00ba5f96/bbca9217-153b-4a88-a157-afb000e827aa/waveform?t=1676989535&token=sXGruNfHi4Sm3zWr59v5SSyM8dwH1nI7", "VideoUrl": null, "EmbedUrl": "https://omny.fm/shows/the-origin-of-things/what-does-that-word-even-mean/embed", "DurationSeconds": 449.802, "PublishState": "Published", "PublishedUrl": "https://omny.fm/shows/the-origin-of-things/what-does-that-word-even-mean", "Visibility": "Public", "PublishedUtc": "2023-02-22T00:30:00Z", "PlaylistIds": ["55749a6f-2d06-48ea-8fbf-af4d00ba5fa8", "0f0809c6-e8dc-4461-8fef-afa100d5b610"], "Chapters": [], "State": "Ready", "Sha